// " " is used to divide symbols so that each symbol should be divided by a " ".
// "\epsilon" is used to describe ε.

Terminal Symbol
+ * ( ) id

Non-Terminal Symbol
E T F

Start Symbol
E

Productions
E \to E + T
E \to T
T \to T * F
T \to F
F \to ( E )
F \to id

Enable Solve Left Recursion
false

LL(1) Sentence
( id + id ) * id

LR(1) Sentence
( id + id ) * id
